nce_tier":"studied"},{"concept_id":"kidney_disease","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":6,"lift":0.46,"evidence_tier":"studied"},{"concept_id":"lactation","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":16,"lift":4.93,"evidence_tier":"studied"},{"concept_id":"liver_disease","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":64,"lift":3.95,"evidence_tier":"studied"},{"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.43,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.32,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"spleen_disease","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":5,"lift":0.62,"evidence_tier":"studied"}],"lead_score":null},"texts":{"cul:292-succory-or-chicory":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Succory, Or Chicory","headword":"Succory, Or Chicory","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"It is an herb of Jupiter. Garden Succory, as it is more dry and less cold than Endive, so it opens more. An handful of the leaves, or roots boiled in wine or water, and a draught thereof drank fasting, drives forth choleric and phlegmatic humours, opens obstructions of the liver, gall and spleen; helps the yellow jaundice, the heat of the reins, and of the urine; the dropsy also; and those that have an evil disposition in their bodies, by reason of long sickness, evil diet, &c. which the Greeks call Cachexia. A decoction thereof made with wine, and drank, is very effectual against long lingering agues; and a dram of the seed in powder, drank in wine, before the fit of the ague, helps to drive it away. The distilled water of the herb and flowers (if you can take them in time) hath the like properties, and is especially good for hot stomachs, and in agues, either pestilential or of long continuance; for swoonings and passions of the heart, for the heat and head-ache in children, and for the blood and liver. The said water, or the juice, or the bruised leaves applied outwardly, allay swellings, inflammations, St. Anthony’s fire, pushes, wheals, and pimples, especially used with a little vinegar; as also to wash pestiferous sores. The said water is very effectual for sore eyes that are inflamed with redness, for nurses’ breasts that are pained by the abundance of milk. The wild Succory, as it is more bitter, so it is more strengthening to the stomach and liver.","spans":[{"start":248,"end":279,"concept_id":"liver_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":290,"end":296,"concept_id":"spleen_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":315,"end":323,"concept_id":"jaundice","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":341,"end":346,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":370,"end":376,"concept_id":"edema_dropsy","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":603,"end":608,"concept_id":"fever","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":681,"end":685,"concept_id":"fever","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":839,"end":851,"concept_id":"dyspepsia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":860,"end":865,"concept_id":"fever","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":874,"end":886,"concept_id":"plague","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":915,"end":924,"concept_id":"heart","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":929,"end":950,"concept_id":"heart","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":969,"end":978,"concept_id":"headache","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1109,"end":1122,"concept_id":"inflammation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1128,"end":1142,"concept_id":"erysipelas","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1144,"end":1150,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1152,"end":1158,"concept_id":"dermatitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1164,"end":1171,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1228,"end":1239,"concept_id":"plague","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1240,"end":1245,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1289,"end":1311,"concept_id":"conjunctivitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start"